==Russian==

===Etymology===
Dialectally also {{m|ru|сля́ться}}. Per Vasmer, quoting Sobolevsky, probably from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*sъljati sę}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*sъlati||to [[send]]}} (whence {{cog|ru|слать}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|шля́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Cinemantique-шляться.wav}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|шля́ться|impf}}

# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[loaf about]], to [[gad]] about

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|1a|шля́ться}}

